[{"client_msg_id":"CBC19336-09F5-429C-854B-6F453B304DD4","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"温しゃぶだし全然少食なので大丈夫ですw","ts":"1628769576.458700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"relieved","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jG+="}]},{"client_msg_id":"7dc3494a-015c-462f-9552-606fd793391d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"胃に近い方で餅でつまったみたいなもんか","ts":"1628768664.457400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kowawa","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"J+3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3dae610e-273f-4537-8901-2887f9619916","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ほどほどの量なら大丈夫か\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/sugikota/status/1331498281055133698\u003e","ts":"1628768637.457000","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/sugikota|@sugikota\u003e: 理由は単に大食いだろ、って、そんなの主因は大食いに決まってるじゃないですか。焼き鳥よりはジンギスカンの方がいくぶん危ねーだろな、って話なんですよ。","id":1,"author_name":"すぎもと こうたろう","author_subname":"@sugikota","author_link":"https://twitter.com/sugikota/status/1331498281055133698","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1382633389371449346/KGRHhO8I_normal.jpg","text":"理由は単に大食いだろ、って、そんなの主因は大食いに決まってるじゃないですか。焼き鳥よりはジンギスカンの方がいくぶん危ねーだろな、って話なんですよ。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1606288902,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/sugikota/status/1331498281055133698","original_url":"https://twitter.com/sugikota/status/1331498281055133698"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pd9y2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"adaa313c-c118-413b-b680-8723be771645","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"冷しゃぶです……？尚のこと、熱いお茶と一緒にしないとやばそう……。\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/tottoto778/status/1330823118697349120\u003e","ts":"1628768509.456500","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/tottoto778|@tottoto778\u003e: 羊肉食うときは熱いお茶と一緒には羊食オタクとしては常識だった。\n中央アジア行ってお腹壊す理由… \u003chttp://twitter.com/sugikota/statu|twitter.com/sugikota/statu\u003e…","id":1,"author_name":"たろいも","author_subname":"@tottoto778","author_link":"https://twitter.com/tottoto778/status/1330823118697349120","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1395305530109751303/97p1Qys6_normal.jpg","text":"羊肉食うときは熱いお茶と一緒には羊食オタクとしては常識だった。\n中央アジア行ってお腹壊す理由… \u003chttp://twitter.com/sugikota/statu|twitter.com/sugikota/statu\u003e…","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1606127931,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/tottoto778/status/1330823118697349120","original_url":"https://twitter.com/tottoto778/status/1330823118697349120"},{"color":"32BBF3","fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/sugikota|@sugikota\u003e: 羊の脂肪の融点はヒトの体温より高いので、ジンギスカンは腸内に詰まりやすい食べ物です。「数時間前から水の一滴も喉を通らなくなった」という患者さんから、上部消化管内視鏡でひたすらジンギスカンを掘り出した経験があります。(私は研修医で当初は介助していたのだが、オーベンが途中で飽きて交代) \u003chttp://twitter.com/japanfossil/st|twitter.com/japanfossil/st\u003e…","id":2,"author_name":"すぎもと こうたろう","author_subname":"@sugikota","author_link":"https://twitter.com/sugikota/status/1330815311684136960","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1382633389371449346/KGRHhO8I_normal.jpg","text":"羊の脂肪の融点はヒトの体温より高いので、ジンギスカンは腸内に詰まりやすい食べ物です。「数時間前から水の一滴も喉を通らなくなった」という患者さんから、上部消化管内視鏡でひたすらジンギスカンを掘り出した経験があります。(私は研修医で当初は介助していたのだが、オーベンが途中で飽きて交代) \u003chttp://twitter.com/japanfossil/st|twitter.com/japanfossil/st\u003e…","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1606126070,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/sugikota/status/1330815311684136960"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RJL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd